Dear Editorial Team at Bloomberg News - Europe Newsroom,

For Bloomberg Technology & Policy desks: The European Commission has official=
ly gazetted Implementing Decision C(2026) 7098, confirming competence under A=
rticles 16, 114, 172 and 173 of the TFEU to admit European Citizens' Initiati=
ve 2026/000012, setting the stage for a pan-European 1M signature campaign to=
 create an ISO/IEC 42001-certified .IA registry.

The initiative now embarks on the March of One Million Signatures across the =
EU. Our coordination committee, technical briefs, and legal gazettes are read=
ily available for your newsroom.

Key Facts of the Official EU Dossier:
- Case File: ECI No. 2026/000012
- Legal Act: Commission Implementing Decision C(2026) 7098 final
- Legal Basis: Articles 16, 114, 172 and 173 of the TFEU
- Objective: Sovereign Digital District (.IA) and ISO/IEC 42001 Ethical AI Fr=
amework

Official Documentation:
- EU Gazette / Official Verdict (PDF): https://anticitera.deft.work/C_2026_70=
98_ES.pdf
- Antikythera Project Portal: https://anticitera.deft.work

Warm regards,
Eloy L=C3=B3pez
Founder & Coordinator, Antikythera Project
https://anticitera.deft.work

